1 REM FBCS FIL-0409
2 REM CLAIM A-11.2.4.1-TR114
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 11.2.4.1 l.7200-7208: successive READ NEXT after a READ walk the existing records, skipping empty areas.
100 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0409.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION RELATIVE, RECTYPE INTERNAL
110 ERASE #1
120 WRITE #1, RECORD 2: 20
130 WRITE #1, RECORD 5: 50
140 WRITE #1, RECORD 6: 60
150 READ #1, RECORD 2: X
160 READ #1, NEXT: Y
170 READ #1, NEXT: Z
180 PRINT X; Y; Z
190 CLOSE #1
200 END
